(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "离开食堂之后，又回到了7F。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00246",
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "本来这个7F是不允许除了来看望的亲属，\n和工作人员以外的人进来的，不知为什么她来却没事。",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00247",
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "倒不如说，护士站的护士们，在看到来的人是明之后，都会轻轻点头致意",
voice: None,
),
),
(
cmd: label,
args: (
name: "block_00248",
),
),
(
cmd: dialogue,
args: (
speaker: None,
text: "……还是对她的事一点都不了解。",
voice: None,
),
),
